### Comprehensive API Test Script
# This script tests all endpoints of the realtime-chat-app API
# Run the requests in order from top to bottom

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5006/api
@authEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/auth
@messageEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/message
@contentType = application/json

### 1. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS ###

### 1.1 Signup request
# Creates a new user account
POST {{authEndpoint}}/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "fullName": "Test User", 
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "testPassword123"
}

### 1.2 Login request
# Authenticates a user and sets JWT cookie
POST {{authEndpoint}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "testPassword123"
}

### 1.3 Check Authentication
# Verifies if the user is authenticated
GET {{authEndpoint}}/check
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 1.4 Update ProfilePage
# Updates the user's profile picture
# Note: Replace the base64 string with an actual base64 encoded image
PUT {{authEndpoint}}/update-profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "profilePic": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
}

### 2. MESSAGE ENDPOINTS ###

### 2.1 Get users for sidebar
# Retrieves a list of users for the sidebar
GET {{messageEndpoint}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2.2 Get messages with a specific user
# Retrieves messages between the authenticated user and another user
# Replace 6859d8a46cad00f92d02b349 with an actual user ID from the previous response
GET {{messageEndpoint}}/6859d8a46cad00f92d02b349
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2.3 Send a text message to a specific user
# Sends a text message to another user
# Replace 6859d8a46cad00f92d02b349 with an actual user ID
POST {{messageEndpoint}}/send/6859d8a46cad00f92d02b349
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "text": "Hello, this is a test message!"
}

### 2.4 Send a message with image to a specific user
# Sends a message with both text and image to another user
# Replace 6859d8a46cad00f92d02b349 with an actual user ID
# Replace the base64 string with an actual base64 encoded image
POST {{messageEndpoint}}/send/6859d8a46cad00f92d02b349
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "text": "Here's an image for you!",
    "image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,"
}

### 3. LOGOUT ###

### 3.1 Logout request
# Logs out the user by clearing the JWT cookie
POST {{authEndpoint}}/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### End of API Test Script